board blinky555 40x30 2L
use psu.ocd as PSU
part U1 SOIC8 NE555
part R1 R0805 1k
part R2 R0805 10k
part R3 R0805 330
part C1 C0805 10u
part C2 C0805 100n
part D1 LED0805 red
net VCC L0 w0.5: U1.8 U1.4 R1.1
net GND L1 w0.5: U1.1 C1.1 C2.2 D1.2
net N_DIS L1: U1.7 R1.2 R2.1
net N_TH L0: U1.6 U1.2 R2.2 C1.2
net N_OUT L1: U1.3 R3.1
net N_LED L0: R3.2 D1.1
net N_CV L0: U1.5 C2.1
fix PSU_J1 at 3 15
keep U1 near C1 3
keep U1 near C2 3
route GND on 1
power VCC GND
